{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.open","lesson_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6","sequence":0,"board":{"board_id":"slope-and-intercept","base_revision":0,"region_intent":"new_topic","region_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6-region"},"lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"一次函数 y = mx + b 的图像与性质","goals":["理解一次函数解析式 y = mx + b 中参数 m（斜率）与 b（纵截距）的几何意义","掌握斜率 m 的正负、零以及绝对值大小对直线方向和倾斜陡缓程度的影响","理解纵截距 b 对直线上下平移的作用，并能从图像上准确读取纵截距","掌握斜率的计算公式 m = Δy / Δx，并能在坐标系中通过两点计算斜率"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["利用函数图像实时联动，直观展示参数 m 和 b 变化对直线的动态影响","结合几何直觉与代数推导，说明斜率作为“纵向变化量与横向变化量之比”的本质"]},"variables":[{"as":"number_01","initial":1,"min":-5,"max":5,"label":"斜率 m","control":{"kind":"slider","step":0.05}},{"as":"number_02","initial":0,"min":-5,"max":5,"label":"纵截距 b","control":{"kind":"slider","step":0.05}}],"tasks":[{"as":"section-02-task-01","prompt":"请将斜率 m 设为 -3，观察负斜率绝对值更大时的倾斜程度。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["拖动斜率 m 的滑块向左移动到 -3","注意观察直线是否依然从左到右下降，且比 m=-2 时更陡峭"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"很好！你成功观察到了负斜率下绝对值越大、倾斜越陡峭的规律。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":-3,"tolerance":0.025}},{"as":"section-03-task-01","prompt":"调整滑块使直线与 y 轴交于 (0, 1)。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["拖动纵截距 b 的滑块移动到 1","注意观察直线与 y 轴的交点 (0, b) 是否移动到 (0, 1)"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"很好！直线的纵截距变为 1，与 y 轴交于 (0, 1)。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_02","controls":["slider"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_02","value":1,"tolerance":0.025}},{"as":"section-04-task-01","prompt":"请拖动滑块将斜率 m 设置为 2，使直线每向右 1 单位，向上增加 2 单位。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["斜率 m 控制直线的倾斜程度","将 m 调整为正数 2"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"太棒了！此时每向右移动 1 个单位（Δx = 1），纵向就向上增加 2 个单位（Δy = 2），斜率 m = 2 / 1 = 2。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":2,"tolerance":0.025}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-01","purpose":"建立一次函数解析式 y = mx + b 中参数 m 与 b 的基本认知","beats":[{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-01:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"欢迎来到一次函数的学习。首先我们来看一次函数的基本解析式：y 等于 m 乘以 x 加 b。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","kind":"plot","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"一次函数图像","axes":{"x":{"min":-4,"max":4,"label":"x"},"y":{"min":-6,"max":6,"label":"y"}},"curves":[{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:primary-curve","expression":"((number_01)*(x))+(number_02)","label":"y = mx + b"}],"points":[{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:reference-p","x":0,"y":0,"label":"P(0, {y})"},{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:reference-q","x":1,"y":1,"label":"Q(1, {y})"}],"bindings":[{"target":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:reference-p.y","expression":"((number_01)*(0))+(number_02)"},{"target":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:reference-q.y","expression":"((number_01)*(1))+(number_02)"}],"measurement":"secant","sample_input":"fixed_x","hint":"固定观察 x = 0 与 x = 1 处的两点 P 和 Q，同步观察直线变化与斜率测量。"},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6-region"}},{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:1:1:3","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"聚焦于一次函数解析式"}}],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:1:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"y = mx + b"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-01:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"在这条直线上，参数 m 决定了直线的倾斜程度和方向，称为斜率；参数 b 决定了直线与 y 轴交点的位置，称为纵截距。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:1:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"参数含义","items":["m：斜率（决定倾斜方向与陡缓）","b：纵截距（直线与 y 轴交点的纵坐标）"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02"},"region_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6-region"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:1:2:2","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6","sequence":2,"step":{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-02","purpose":"探究斜率 m 的正负、零与绝对值大小对直线方向和陡缓的影响","beats":[{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-02:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"现在我们保持纵截距 b 不变，专门观察斜率 m 的变化对直线方向和倾斜程度的影响。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:2:1:1","op":"teacher.expression","expression":"neutral"}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-02:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"当 m 大于 0 时，比如现在的 m 等于 1，直线从左到右上升，函数值 y 随 x 的增大而增大。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:2:2:1","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-02:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"尝试将斜率 m 调整为 3 看看。随着 m 的绝对值变大，直线会变得更加陡峭。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:2:3:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":3,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-02:beat:moment-04","narration":{"text":"当 m 等于 0 时，直线变成水平线，此时 y 不随 x 改变，恒为 b。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:2:4:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":0,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-02:beat:moment-05","narration":{"text":"当 m 小于 0 时，例如 m 等于 -2，直线从左到右下降，y 随 x 的增大而减小。|m| 越大，下降得同样越陡峭。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:2:5:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":-2,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6","sequence":3,"step":{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-03","purpose":"探究纵截距 b 对直线的上下平移作用及图像读取方法","beats":[{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-03:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"现在保持斜率 m 不变，改变纵截距 b 的值。观察直线是如何随着 b 的变化发生平移的。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:3:1:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_02","to":3,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-03:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"当 b 增加到 3 时，直线向上平行移动，与 y 轴相交于点 (0, 3)。这里的 3 就是纵截距。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:3:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"\\text{直线与 y 轴交点为 } (0, b)"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6-region"}},{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:3:2:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"强调纵截距在y轴上的位置"}}]}},{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-03:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"接下来试着把 b 调整为负数 -2，观察直线的位置变化。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:3:3:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_02","to":-2,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:3:3:2","op":"teacher.expression","expression":"neutral"}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6","sequence":4,"step":{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-04","purpose":"理解斜率 m = Δy / Δx 的几何含义并通过两点操作完成互动实践","beats":[{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-04:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"现在我们来看斜率 m 的定量定义。斜率表示直线在坐标系中的倾斜程度，它等于纵向变化量 Δy 除以横向变化量 Δx。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:4:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-04-moment-01-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"m = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x} = \\frac{y_2 - y_1}{x_2 - x_1}"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6-region"}},{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:4:1:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-04-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"理解斜率公式中的纵向变化与横向变化之比"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-04:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"在当前的直线上，当横向移动一定的距离 Δx 时，纵向对应的变化就是 Δy。两者的比值决定了直线的陡缓程度。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:4:2:1","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:step:section-04:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"现在请进入课后练习。首先请你保持纵截距不变，尝试将斜率 m 调整为 -3。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:action:4:3:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"继续观察当前画面"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.close","lesson_id":"slope-and-intercept-0.1.6","sequence":5,"result":{"summary":"本课程深入探讨了一次函数 y = mx + b 的几何特征。我们明确了 m 为斜率，反映直线的倾斜方向与陡缓，对应变化率 Δy / Δx；b 为纵截距，决定直线与 y 轴交点的位置及上下平移。","summary_node_refs":[],"suggested_focus":["slope-and-intercept-0.1.6:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"]}}
